  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;BRENDA BURROWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Brenda Burrows is a member of the peerage, known for her elegance and poise, and has recently married George Nasson Johnstone. She is 35 years old and met Johnstone at a charity gala in London."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GEORGE NASSON JOHNSTONE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"George Nasson Johnstone is a respected gentleman from a prominent family, 83 years old, and has recently married Brenda Burrows. He met her at a charity gala in London and is described as having a kind heart and a sense of humor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOHNSTONE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Johnstone is a retired businessman and husband of Brenda Burrows. He is 83 years old and met Burrows at a charity gala in London."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bride refers to Brenda Burrows, who is getting married to George Nasson Johnstone."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRIDAL GOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bridal Gown is a custom-made lace gown worn by Brenda Burrows during her wedding ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON, ENGLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"London, England is the city where Brenda Burrows and George Nasson Johnstone met and where the wedding ceremony took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIVATE ESTATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Private Estate is the location where Brenda Burrows and George Nasson Johnstone's wedding ceremony took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITABLE FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charitable Foundation is a planned organization to be established by Brenda Burrows and George Nasson Johnstone in their names."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY VICTORIA WINDSOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Windsor is a close friend of Brenda Burrows and has expressed her congratulations on the marriage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STEPHEN PATRICK CASS ALEXANDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander is a distinguished gentleman from the Alexander clan, born in 1928, and has been married to Brenda Burrows for a lifetime. He is a member of the British aristocracy and has a military background."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALEXANDER CLAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alexander Clan is the family of Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander, known for its rich history and military service."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BURROWS FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Burrows Family is the family of Brenda Burrows, known for its long association with the British aristocracy and its rich history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH ARISTOCRACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"British Aristocracy is the social class of which both Brenda Burrows and Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander are members, characterized by lineage and heritage."&lt;SEP&gt;"The British aristocracy is mentioned as a declining social structure that the couple faced during their relationship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOBILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nobility refers to the traditional trappings of the British aristocracy, such as lavish estates and high-society gatherings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POST-WAR ERA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Post-War Era is the period after World War II, during which the British aristocracy underwent significant social changes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAVISH GATHERINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lavish Gatherings are the social events hosted by the Burrows and Alexander families, reflecting their status in British society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITY GALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charity Gala is the event where Brenda Burrows and George Nasson Johnstone met, organized for charitable purposes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEERAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Peerage is the class of nobility in the United Kingdom, to which Brenda Burrows belongs."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RETIRED BUSINESSMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Retired Businessman is the occupation of George Nasson Johnstone before his marriage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MILITARY BACKGROUND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Military Background is the background of Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander, who served in the military."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charity is the cause for which the Charity Gala was organized."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LINEN GOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Linen Gown is another term for the custom-made lace gown worn by Brenda Burrows during her wedding ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLOSE FRIENDS AND FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Close Friends and Family are the guests who attended the wedding ceremony."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"They refer to a couple whose bond grew stronger over time, symbolizing devotion and loyalty."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MODERNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Modernity is referenced as a rising force that contrasted with the declining British aristocracy, representing societal changes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aging is an inevitable trial that the couple experienced, symbolizing the passage of time and its effects."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECLINE OF THE BRITISH ARISTOCRACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The decline of the British aristocracy is a significant historical event that the couple faced during their relationship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RISE OF MODERNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rise of modernity is a significant societal change that the couple faced during their relationship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRIALS OF AGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The trials of aging are personal challenges that the couple experienced, symbolizing the passage of time and its effects."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTANT, A BEACON OF HOPE AND STABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The constant, beacon of hope and stability represents the enduring nature of their love and its positive impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVER-CHANGING WORLD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ever-changing world is a metaphor for the dynamic environment in which the couple lived, reflecting the broader context of their lives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0441</data>
    </node>
